## Description

Today we're open-sourcing nac, an agent harness for long-running tasks, and launching the Arcee open models API beta.  Nac is available now under Apache 2.0 on GitHub, built for developers running complex, multi-step engineering workloads. https://t.co/Dl17GJdg8d

